["Sila Nuti qoma kee siif hin bal'ifnee?","Ba’aa (badii) kee sirraa buufne.","Isa dugda keetti ulfaate (sirraa buufne).","Maqaa keetis siif ol kaafne.","Rakkinaa wajjin laafinatu jira.","Dhugumatti, rakkina wajjin laafinatu jira.","Yeroo (dalagaa wahii) raawwatte xaari (ta biraa ittifufi).","Gara Gooftaa keetii qofa kajeeli."]